{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1238624-on-having-npc-hunter-groups","id":1238624,"title":"On having NPC hunter groups","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-07-25T10:43:54-07:00","id":1238624,"title":"On having NPC hunter groups","content":"From reading earlier threads I see some forumers believe some compacts and conspiracies should be antagonist only (examples include the abbey, promethean brotherhood, and VERY rarely nowadays, the chieron group). The purpose of this thread is to see all of your different opinions on whether we should have NPC only hunter groups<br /> <br /> Personally, I believe every compact and conspiracy should be playable, no matter how amoral they are, nor do I think any group should just be ret-conned, instead I believe they should just be improved upon once 2nd edition comes out (I'm mostly referring to the keepers and the illuminated). My stance is mostly because while hunter does have a &quot;humanity fuck yeah&quot; undertone to It (and overtones with certain groups). Hunters should not be a well and pure heroes and should be open to all players","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-27T03:49:11-07:00","id":1239245,"title":"","content":"I don't think the idea of having amoral hunter groups is at all inconsistent with the tone of Vigil. You can end up in these groups and quickly become a monster yourself, only realising too late that you've become as much as a threat to humankind as your enemies. IMO that should definitely be an omnipresent threat in Hunter, and it can't really be one if it's impossible for players to join those groups and get led down a dark and dangerous path.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24074-ciniselli","name":"Ciniselli","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}